## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Rule memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus rich dispatch-spec slots:

- **`event`** (required) — which lifecycle event triggers evaluation
- **`enforcement`** (required) — `audit` / `warn` / `block`
- **`actor`** — actor rel-paths or `:any`
- **`context`** — context rel-paths, path globs, tool-name patterns, or `:any`
- **`bypass`** — list of (actor, context) tuples exempt
- **`priority`** — numeric utility score within-scope
- **`engine`** — `:plain-pattern` / `:malli` / `:clara-rules` / `:core.logic` / `:meander-strategy`
- **`lifecycle`** — `active` / `experimental` / `deprecated` / `superseded`
- **`dispatch-strategy`** — `:graph-query` (default) / `:match-compile` (hot-path optimization)
- **`inherits-from`** — parent context for lattice-with-lifting inheritance

